<title>CHILE: Masisa reports nearly flat Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Masisa reports nearly flat Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wood products manufacturing company Maderas y Sinteticos SA (Masisa) reported the following results in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>				Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		    3.05			3.01</p>
<p> Operating profit	    1.8			 1.2</p>
<p> Non-operating profit	1.4			 1.9</p>
<p> Total revenues	     11.5			 9.9</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
